WEBVTT

00:02.790 --> 00:05.130
The New Gate.

00:06.550 --> 00:12.640
It is the most advanced VR MMORPG
created using state-of-the-art technology.

00:13.390 --> 00:17.640
Take on an adventure as freely as you want
in this world you see with your own eyes.

00:17.640 --> 00:17.640
Take on an adventure as freely as you want
in this world you see with your own eyes.
(Elf, Beast, Dragnil, Dwarf, Pixie, Lord, Human)

00:17.640 --> 00:18.600
(Elf, Beast, Dragnil, Dwarf, Pixie, Lord, Human)

00:18.600 --> 00:23.650
(Elf, Beast, Dragnil, Dwarf, Pixie, Lord, Human)
Create your new self
from the seven unique races.

00:23.650 --> 00:27.150
Defeat powerful monsters
together with your friends,

00:27.150 --> 00:29.910
make a huge fortune through trading,

00:29.910 --> 00:33.910
or you could also become a smithy
and forge legendary weapons.

00:34.450 --> 00:40.040
This is the VR MMORPG where you can
turn your imagination into reality.

00:40.040 --> 00:42.500
The New Gate!

00:42.500 --> 00:45.050
Currently a global bestseller.

00:49.720 --> 00:54.050
One day, The New Gate
turned into a death game.

01:00.100 --> 01:02.020
Players can no longer log out,

01:02.020 --> 01:04.520
and death inside the game
means death in the real world.

01:07.480 --> 01:09.280
Y-you...

01:09.280 --> 01:11.780
Could you be Shin?

01:17.410 --> 01:22.420
I kept on fighting to end
this miserable game.

01:23.170 --> 01:25.670
Are you leaving already, Master?

01:25.670 --> 01:29.420
If we can meet again, I hope you
can honor me with a serious duel.

01:29.420 --> 01:31.800
Please, take care.

01:31.800 --> 01:34.180
Yeah. I'll be going.

01:42.690 --> 01:45.440
Of course, the last boss
moves fast despite its size!

01:46.060 --> 01:48.940
But your head is mine!

01:51.030 --> 01:52.950
Damnit, he dodged it?!

01:55.990 --> 01:59.450
Stay focused. If I can beat him,
then everything will...

01:59.450 --> 02:00.700
(Gatekeeper Origin)

02:02.500 --> 02:04.710
He can recover his broken parts?

02:04.710 --> 02:06.790
Don't even think about recovering!

02:07.880 --> 02:09.590
Steel Repulse!

02:20.890 --> 02:22.730
(Gatekeeper Origin)

02:22.730 --> 02:24.840
Still trying to recover...

02:24.840 --> 02:26.230
However!

02:26.230 --> 02:27.730
Dance of Moonlit Blade!

02:29.860 --> 02:32.400
This ends now!

02:43.210 --> 02:45.960
Gatekeeper Origin has been defeated.

02:46.500 --> 02:50.500
New titles received: The Transcended,
The Accomplished, The Liberator.

02:51.420 --> 02:53.010
With the dungeon cleared,

02:53.010 --> 02:56.050
players are now allowed to
log out of the game.

02:57.680 --> 02:59.890
It's finally over...

02:59.890 --> 03:02.140
I should double-check
if everyone can actually log out.

03:05.940 --> 03:07.650
Oh, it's disappearing.

03:07.650 --> 03:11.610
Looks like everyone is smoothly
getting out of the game.

03:17.400 --> 03:21.280
(Shin)

03:21.280 --> 03:21.780
(Shin)
Looks like I'm the last one.

03:21.780 --> 03:24.160
Looks like I'm the last one.

03:25.790 --> 03:28.790
(Play guide, config, logout)
Goodbye then, The New Gate.

03:28.790 --> 03:29.290
(Play guide, config, logout)

03:31.040 --> 03:32.290
What?

03:32.840 --> 03:34.800
There shouldn't be any more events!

03:36.800 --> 03:40.510
By that point, I should've
cleared the game...

03:51.190 --> 03:55.280
Am I still in the game?

03:57.530 --> 04:00.530
No, this is too realistic for that.

04:00.530 --> 04:05.290
VR technology has gone a long way,
but it shouldn't be this realistic.

04:05.790 --> 04:07.180
Oh right.

04:07.180 --> 04:08.870
Looks like I can open the menu.

04:08.870 --> 04:12.460
Wait, my stats went up by a ton!

04:12.460 --> 04:15.380
Is this because of the title that I got
from defeating the last boss?

04:15.380 --> 04:20.110
Well, since I cleared the game,
I should be able to log out, right?

04:20.110 --> 04:21.050
It's gone...

04:21.050 --> 04:23.050
(Play guide, config)
The logout button is gone!

04:23.050 --> 04:25.150
No way, you got to be kidding me!

04:25.150 --> 04:26.430
Oh right, what about everybody else?

04:26.430 --> 04:27.850
(Cannot display.)
Oh right, what about everybody else?

04:27.850 --> 04:30.060
(Unable to establish network connection)
No network connection?!

04:30.060 --> 04:33.480
If that's the case, the game
shouldn't even be working!

04:33.480 --> 04:35.820
Does that mean this is reality?!

04:36.400 --> 04:38.070
I don't get it!

04:38.070 --> 04:41.320
I just went through a death game,
now I have to live in an isekai?!

04:43.950 --> 04:46.330
I can't do anything by just sitting here.

04:47.320 --> 04:51.080
Well, I have a home point registered,
so if I use this...

04:55.340 --> 04:57.960
All right, time to head back home!

05:07.430 --> 05:10.190
When did they put up these walls?

05:10.190 --> 05:12.600
I can see a castle,
so this is a whole town?

05:15.690 --> 05:16.650
(The Moon Sanctum)
There it is! My home sweet home!

05:16.650 --> 05:18.650
There it is! My home sweet home!

05:18.650 --> 05:20.610
How many times must I repeat myself?!

05:20.610 --> 05:23.110
My master is out and
won't return for a while!

05:23.110 --> 05:24.950
You're just hiding her, aren't you?!

05:24.950 --> 05:28.370
If you won't tell us,
then we'll have to do it the hard way!

05:28.370 --> 05:30.870
Stop! If I go any further than this...!

05:53.190 --> 05:55.150
- I see.
- Huh?!

05:55.150 --> 05:58.190
I can adjust a magic skill's output.

05:58.190 --> 06:01.650
Physical attacks have
a feedback to my own self.

06:01.650 --> 06:03.450
It feels so realistic.

06:03.450 --> 06:05.410
Uh, umm...

06:06.200 --> 06:09.910
Oh, err... I'm back...?

06:09.910 --> 06:11.410
(The Moon Sanctum)

06:11.410 --> 06:15.670
Thank you for saving me.
My name is Tiera Lucent.

06:15.670 --> 06:17.290
My name's Shin.

06:17.290 --> 06:18.500
Shin, I see.

06:18.500 --> 06:23.130
Are you an acquaintance of my master?
You mentioned being back...

06:23.130 --> 06:24.220
Master?

06:24.220 --> 06:25.680
What are you talking about?

06:26.140 --> 06:30.560
Who doesn't know about The Moon Sanctum's
acting proprietor, Schnee Raizar?

06:30.560 --> 06:33.480
Schnee Raizar, huh?

06:33.480 --> 06:34.940
Schnee...

06:34.940 --> 06:36.310
Schnee Raizar?!

06:36.310 --> 06:41.070
Do you mean the high elf
with waist-length silver hair?

06:41.070 --> 06:42.820
That gorgeous beauty?!

06:43.630 --> 06:45.820
Unless it's a different person
with the same name,

06:46.240 --> 06:49.330
this Schnee should be
one of my support characters.

06:49.330 --> 06:53.080
So that's why
The Moon Sanctum still exists.

06:56.330 --> 07:01.170
Oh, err, you could say that
she's an old acquaintance.

07:01.170 --> 07:03.670
So, where is she right now?

07:03.670 --> 07:05.720
I won't tell you that easily.

07:05.720 --> 07:10.760
We've only met, and the hoodlums
from before were also looking for her.

07:10.760 --> 07:13.360
But I can at least relay
a message to her.

07:13.360 --> 07:14.350
Message?

07:14.350 --> 07:18.690
My job is to manage the shop
and facilitate contact with her.

07:18.690 --> 07:20.860
One message will cost you 1000 jul.

07:20.860 --> 07:22.690
A thousand jul?

07:22.690 --> 07:26.240
Uh, I'm only carrying geyl right now...

07:27.950 --> 07:31.830
Hang on, did you just take
that out of an inventory?

07:31.830 --> 07:33.950
Yeah. What's wrong?

07:33.950 --> 07:35.500
What do you mean, "What's wrong"?!

07:35.500 --> 07:40.430
Only kings and elders of
a few races can use inventories!

07:40.430 --> 07:44.130
Not to mention, a gold geyl
can be used to amplify magic!

07:44.130 --> 07:46.930
A single one can be exchanged
for at least ten billion Jul!

07:46.930 --> 07:48.130
Ten billion?!

07:48.130 --> 07:51.810
But one geyl is the smallest unit
of currency in the game!

07:51.810 --> 07:54.140
Just who are you?

07:54.930 --> 07:56.850
I'm just an adventurer.

07:56.850 --> 08:00.150
My charac... My race is high human.

08:00.400 --> 08:02.440
High human?

08:02.440 --> 08:04.650
But high human is supposed to be extinct.

08:04.650 --> 08:08.450
Extinct? You mean the humans died out?!

08:08.450 --> 08:12.370
The ones that went extinct were
the higher race, high humans.

08:12.370 --> 08:15.080
I mean, the hoodlums
just now were also humans.

08:15.080 --> 08:16.290
Oh, right.

08:16.290 --> 08:19.920
There used to be only
six high humans in this world.

08:19.920 --> 08:24.880
They all vanished during the
"Sunset on Prosperity" 500 years ago.

08:24.880 --> 08:26.300
Sunset on Prosperity?

08:26.300 --> 08:28.760
You don't know about the
Sunset on Prosperity either?

08:28.760 --> 08:34.430
Including high human, many people
vanished in that historical incident.

08:34.430 --> 08:37.100
A huge number of people disappearing...

08:37.100 --> 08:37.810
Could it be?

08:38.280 --> 08:42.060
Back then, tens of thousands of people
were stuck inside the game.

08:42.060 --> 08:44.820
If that many people disappeared, then
of course it would be a major incident.

08:45.400 --> 08:48.330
So if I have to guess from that,

08:48.330 --> 08:51.700
this world is 500 years
after the game's setting?

08:51.700 --> 08:53.850
Hey, are you listening?

08:54.450 --> 08:57.790
Oh, uh, thank you
for telling me about all that.

08:57.790 --> 08:59.660
I'll give you this as a thanks.

08:59.660 --> 09:00.460
Wha?!

09:00.460 --> 09:02.920
I'll be counting on you again
in the future.

09:02.920 --> 09:04.750
Again, are you listening?!

09:04.750 --> 09:08.210
What kind of fool would just
hand over something so valuable?!

09:09.670 --> 09:10.470
Me.

09:12.550 --> 09:14.510
You won't ask me
to return it later, right?

09:14.510 --> 09:16.220
Of course not.

09:18.220 --> 09:21.520
A gold geyl that I've been dreaming of...

09:21.520 --> 09:24.230
It has such a wonderful,
sparkly design.

09:26.730 --> 09:30.240
W-well, elves use magic,
so I'm sure it'll come in handy.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.340
Elf?

09:32.280 --> 09:34.740
Do I look like an elf to you?

09:34.740 --> 09:39.080
Yeah, you're definitely a pretty elf
with black hair and gold eyes.

09:39.080 --> 09:43.720
But how? Master Raizar
cast a spell of illusion for me...

09:44.250 --> 09:45.500
Why would you do that?

09:46.840 --> 09:50.510
An elf with black hair is
a cursed sign of ill fortune.

09:50.510 --> 09:52.260
What do you mean?

09:53.220 --> 09:56.720
Yes. This black hair
brings forth disaster.

09:57.390 --> 10:00.230
Monsters would frequently
attack my village,

10:00.230 --> 10:02.270
so I was banished.

10:02.940 --> 10:05.270
It was then that my master saved me.

10:06.220 --> 10:09.270
(The Moon Sanctum)
This shop is protected by a barrier,

10:09.270 --> 10:12.570
and my master cast a spell
of illusion to hide my identity.

10:12.570 --> 10:15.250
That's how I lived safely here
for a hundred years.

10:15.370 --> 10:19.280
I see. So she got attacked
just now because of her curse.

10:19.280 --> 10:22.460
Isn't there any way to lift the curse?

10:22.460 --> 10:26.210
My master has been searching for it,
but nothing so far.

10:26.210 --> 10:27.460
But it's okay.

10:27.460 --> 10:32.550
I can live without bothering anyone
as long as I stay inside the barrier.

10:33.000 --> 10:34.240
But still...

10:35.720 --> 10:38.460
Was your hair black since the beginning?

10:39.050 --> 10:42.310
No, it was silver before this.

10:42.310 --> 10:45.550
But one day I got cursed
and it suddenly became black.

10:45.550 --> 10:46.560
Suddenly?

10:47.230 --> 10:49.980
A curse that turned
hair black in an instant,

10:49.980 --> 10:53.440
getting attacked by monsters, that's...

10:54.360 --> 10:55.820
I know! I know of one!

10:56.910 --> 10:58.780
Why did I even forget that?

10:58.780 --> 11:01.660
Let's see, open the skill menu...

11:01.660 --> 11:03.580
It should be around here.

11:03.580 --> 11:05.660
Uh, what are you doing?

11:05.660 --> 11:07.330
There it is, Analyze!

11:09.000 --> 11:10.840
(Cursed Gift)
I knew it!

11:10.840 --> 11:12.170
(Cursed Gift)
What is going on?

11:12.170 --> 11:14.340
The name of your curse is Cursed Gift.

11:14.340 --> 11:18.850
(Cursed Gift)
It's what caused your hair to change color
and monsters to be attracted to you.

11:18.850 --> 11:21.350
It's a curse that happens randomly.

11:21.350 --> 11:24.100
But just knowing
what kind of curse it is isn't...

11:24.100 --> 11:26.610
I know a way to lift the curse.

11:28.410 --> 11:29.430
Here I go.

11:30.770 --> 11:31.980
Purify.

11:39.610 --> 11:40.570
Huh?

11:41.910 --> 11:43.660
Did it fail?

11:43.660 --> 11:46.370
No, the Purify did work.

11:46.370 --> 11:50.130
But only a little bit
of your hair changed back.

11:54.800 --> 11:57.840
Tiera, I don't know what to say...

11:57.840 --> 12:01.390
Thank you... Thank you so much!

12:01.390 --> 12:02.140
But...

12:02.140 --> 12:05.680
It's enough!
It's more than I had ever hoped for!

12:05.680 --> 12:08.640
I finally saw my own true hair
in a hundred years!

12:12.400 --> 12:15.490
Oh, I'm so sorry for the outburst.

12:15.490 --> 12:19.780
I still can't believe that
the curse has been lifted.

12:19.780 --> 12:22.660
Then do you want to try
going out beyond the barrier?

12:25.540 --> 12:26.910
It'll be all right.

12:26.910 --> 12:29.790
Even if monsters do show up,
I'll take care of them.

12:29.790 --> 12:31.540
But I still...

12:31.540 --> 12:34.340
You've been cooped up
for a hundred years, right?

12:34.340 --> 12:35.040
(The Moon Sanctum)

12:36.230 --> 12:37.300
It will be all right.

12:42.260 --> 12:44.050
All right, here we go.

13:03.070 --> 13:04.990
Looks like nothing's happening.

13:04.990 --> 13:06.490
You're right...

13:07.040 --> 13:09.910
Looks like we managed
to get rid of the curse, after all.

13:09.910 --> 13:11.830
So it seems...

13:14.850 --> 13:16.210
Hey, Shin...

13:19.700 --> 13:22.160
I forgot how vast the sky is...

13:28.100 --> 13:29.470
It sure is.

13:30.970 --> 13:32.390
(The Moon Sanctum)

13:32.390 --> 13:33.980
(The Moon Sanctum)
I'm glad I can be of help.

13:33.980 --> 13:36.270
I am truly grateful for your help.

13:36.270 --> 13:38.320
What are you planning to do now, Shin?

13:38.320 --> 13:40.860
My master won't be back anytime soon.

13:40.860 --> 13:43.360
Then maybe I'll take a look
at that nearby town.

13:44.120 --> 13:47.130
I need to know more about this world.

13:47.130 --> 13:49.000
If this is the same Schnee
we're talking about,

13:49.000 --> 13:52.440
there's a high chance other
support characters also exist.

13:52.450 --> 13:53.750
Oh, right.

13:53.750 --> 13:57.250
I have something useful if you want
to go to Bayrelicht Kingdom.

13:57.250 --> 14:01.010
Bay...? I guess that's
the town I passed by before.

14:01.010 --> 14:03.510
Here you are.
It's a letter of introduction.

14:03.510 --> 14:08.680
You can pass right through
the town's checkpoint with it.

14:08.680 --> 14:09.810
This is great.

14:09.810 --> 14:14.140
But is it really okay to hand this
to someone you just met today?

14:14.140 --> 14:17.270
I mean, you've broken my curse,
and you seem capable.

14:17.270 --> 14:20.320
Not to mention,
you are so infuriatingly kind.

14:20.320 --> 14:22.280
Do you really need to add that last part?

14:22.860 --> 14:25.530
If anything, I still don't feel like
I've paid you back enough.

14:25.530 --> 14:26.990
Huh? Did you say something?

14:27.990 --> 14:30.540
N-nothing! Nothing at all!

14:30.540 --> 14:32.620
All right then, I will be going.

14:32.620 --> 14:35.330
I will inform my master once she returns.

14:35.330 --> 14:37.460
Okay, please do.

14:39.210 --> 14:42.050
So I can actually bypass all that line?

14:42.050 --> 14:44.400
This letter of introduction
sure is something.

14:44.400 --> 14:45.800
It's more than that.

14:45.800 --> 14:49.760
You can even get an audience
with the king with it.

14:49.760 --> 14:52.560
- You'll be in trouble if you lose it.
- S-seriously?

14:58.110 --> 15:00.070
This is the adventurers' guild.

15:00.570 --> 15:02.650
Okay then, I'll be going.

15:02.650 --> 15:05.110
Sure. Thanks for the help.

15:05.110 --> 15:08.320
All right, this is a good place
to start looking for information.

15:09.240 --> 15:11.080
Welcome to the adventurers' guild.

15:11.080 --> 15:13.830
How can we help you today?

15:13.830 --> 15:17.170
Um, uhh...

15:17.170 --> 15:19.590
I'd like to register as an adventurer...

15:19.590 --> 15:21.380
If you wish to apply,

15:21.380 --> 15:25.380
you can do it at the counter
after the stairs on your left.

15:25.380 --> 15:27.260
O-okay...

15:27.970 --> 15:31.100
Welcome. Are you here
to register as an adventurer?

15:31.100 --> 15:33.470
Huh...? Y-yeah, I am.

15:34.230 --> 15:35.850
Is something the matter?

15:35.850 --> 15:39.150
No, you just look a lot like
the receptionist downstairs.

15:39.150 --> 15:41.520
That is my twin sister, Celica.

15:41.520 --> 15:43.110
I am Cilica.

15:43.860 --> 15:46.900
Then first, we'll need your registration fee.

15:46.900 --> 15:50.120
Then, please fill out this form.

15:51.530 --> 15:56.120
I didn't expect it'll take a whole day
until the guild card is finished.

15:58.000 --> 16:00.210
Looking at the people here,

16:00.210 --> 16:03.630
they mostly carry bronze and iron weapons,
and leather or iron armour.

16:04.340 --> 16:07.130
Seems the general quality has dropped
from when I played the game.

16:07.130 --> 16:09.630
Thank you for the wait, Mr. Shin.

16:11.720 --> 16:14.100
Miss Celica? How come?

16:14.100 --> 16:17.390
I help out here when reception is slow.

16:17.390 --> 16:19.900
But you're even in a new outfit.

16:20.810 --> 16:22.320
Uh, can I help?

16:22.320 --> 16:24.510
Please, enjoy your meal.

16:24.520 --> 16:25.400
Right...

16:29.700 --> 16:30.820
This is good.

16:31.410 --> 16:33.240
Stare...

16:33.240 --> 16:35.410
The food is good,
but it's hard to eat like this.

16:35.410 --> 16:37.620
U-um, Miss Celica?

16:37.620 --> 16:41.750
I'm sorry. The truth is,
there is one thing I like to confirm.

16:41.750 --> 16:44.720
I see. What do you want to check?

16:46.300 --> 16:49.220
Your letter of introduction from
The Moon Sanctum, for example.

16:49.220 --> 16:50.680
O-okay...

16:51.640 --> 16:56.310
Can we verify its authenticity
in a different room?

16:56.310 --> 16:59.020
I'm fine as long as
you let me finish my meal.

16:59.020 --> 17:04.000
Just don't tell me that I have to meet
with the guild master face-to-face there.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.320
Well, about that...

17:05.320 --> 17:08.280
He's already here.

17:11.540 --> 17:12.660
Hi there.

17:12.660 --> 17:15.080
It's the weird guy at the reception!

17:16.120 --> 17:20.080
To reiterate, I am Barlux Heim,
the guild master.

17:20.080 --> 17:23.250
Shin. Nice to meet you.

17:23.250 --> 17:25.500
Shin, I'd like to cut to the chase.

17:25.500 --> 17:28.090
Can you show me
the letter of introduction?

17:28.090 --> 17:29.550
Here.

17:30.630 --> 17:33.010
I will check its authenticity.

17:35.810 --> 17:39.310
When letters of introduction are put close
to one another, they resonate and glow.

17:39.310 --> 17:41.600
No mistaking it, yours is genuine.

17:41.600 --> 17:43.100
So they're designed to do that?

17:43.100 --> 17:48.530
Who did you get this letter from?
Is it Schnee? Or Tiera?

17:48.530 --> 17:49.940
It's Tiera.

17:49.940 --> 17:54.120
Something big must've happened
if she forgot to explain that.

17:55.030 --> 17:57.370
Then I'll explain in her place.

17:57.370 --> 18:01.120
With that letter, you can enter
most countries without inspection.

18:01.120 --> 18:03.790
Every guild will accommodate you,

18:03.790 --> 18:07.840
and in certain countries including here,
you can get an audience with the King.

18:07.840 --> 18:11.630
That's how much prestige
this letter brings its bearer.

18:11.630 --> 18:16.930
What an exceptional treatment.
That Schnee must've gotten super famous.

18:16.930 --> 18:19.180
That's how much power it has.

18:19.180 --> 18:21.800
Of course, there are people willing
to steal it for foul purposes.

18:22.270 --> 18:23.390
I can see that.

18:24.230 --> 18:27.060
So I will be blunt.

18:27.060 --> 18:30.440
If you don't have the confidence
to keep that letter safe,

18:30.440 --> 18:32.900
then you should dispose
of it here and now.

18:33.610 --> 18:35.200
Don't worry.

18:35.200 --> 18:39.910
If Tiera entrusted it to me,
then I will live up to her expectations.

18:42.330 --> 18:44.040
Well said!

18:44.040 --> 18:47.630
Let's get along, as two men who are
vouched by The Moon Sanctum.

18:47.630 --> 18:50.170
I have big expectations of you.

18:51.230 --> 18:52.310
Thanks.

18:53.420 --> 18:57.300
Now then, how about we test
your abilities right away?

18:57.300 --> 18:58.200
Huh?

19:01.810 --> 19:04.310
I'm so tired...

19:05.940 --> 19:08.670
What a really busy day.

19:12.540 --> 19:17.040
If my guild card is ready tomorrow,
maybe I'll try raising my rank.

19:17.820 --> 19:22.610
Good grief, I wonder when
Schnee will be back...

19:23.830 --> 19:25.830
Right...

19:25.830 --> 19:31.340
Of course, I won't be back
in the real world after waking up.

19:32.340 --> 19:34.340
Good morning, Mr. Shin.

19:34.340 --> 19:36.420
Did you have a good sleep?

19:36.420 --> 19:40.390
Yes, I managed to get a good inn
thanks to your help.

19:40.400 --> 19:44.350
Oh, I see you have new gear.

19:44.350 --> 19:46.940
It's easier to move in these.

19:46.940 --> 19:51.110
Would be weird if a lowest ranked
adventurer had strong gears.

19:51.860 --> 19:54.480
All right, this is your guild card.

19:54.480 --> 19:54.480
All right, this is your guild card.
(Guild card. Shin. Adventurer rank: G)

19:54.480 --> 19:55.280
(Guild card. Shin. Adventurer rank: G)

19:55.280 --> 20:01.240
(Guild card. Shin. Adventurer rank: G)
Ranks start from SS and S at the top,
then A to G, for a total of nine ranks.

20:01.240 --> 20:03.490
(Guild card. Shin. Adventurer rank: G)
Each quest you complete will add
points and rank you up over time.

20:03.490 --> 20:05.290
Each quest you complete will add
points and rank you up over time.

20:05.290 --> 20:09.250
You can accept quests up to
two ranks higher than your own.

20:09.250 --> 20:11.500
There's a quest I'd like to do right away.

20:11.500 --> 20:14.340
Ah, hilkweed collecting?

20:14.340 --> 20:18.930
They're always in demand as ingredients
for potions, so there is no deadline.

20:18.930 --> 20:19.880
Got it.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.050
I will be going then.

20:22.050 --> 20:23.390
Take care.

20:25.680 --> 20:30.150
For someone vouched by Barlux,
he doesn't seem intimidating at all.

20:30.150 --> 20:32.150
How curious.

20:35.650 --> 20:38.740
I've been looking for around three hours.

20:38.740 --> 20:41.700
Gathering hilkweed is one
of the earliest quests in the game,

20:41.700 --> 20:43.910
so I thought it would be easy.

20:44.450 --> 20:48.260
Well, the monsters here can be
defeated with low-rank equipment,

20:48.260 --> 20:49.730
so I guess I can take my time.

20:52.210 --> 20:55.170
A monster?
But what's with this movement?

20:56.960 --> 20:58.880
It should be around here.

21:05.560 --> 21:08.020
That's a Skullface Jack...

21:08.020 --> 21:09.180
(Monster: Skullface Jack)

21:09.180 --> 21:13.940
Level 359. That's strong.

21:15.020 --> 21:16.530
A carriage...

21:16.530 --> 21:19.440
So the weird movement on the map is
because it was wreaking havoc.

21:20.070 --> 21:23.740
I heard someone died from being
attacked by a Skullface Jack.

21:23.740 --> 21:26.790
I know the guy. What a shame.

21:26.790 --> 21:30.250
He's too dangerous to be ignored.
I'll take him on.

21:37.350 --> 21:38.630
He's so fast.

21:39.420 --> 21:44.640
Never heard of an undead monster wielding
a holy elemental great sword either.

21:44.640 --> 21:47.680
This guy must be a unique monster!

21:54.270 --> 21:56.770
I'm not doing much damage, huh?

21:57.270 --> 21:59.780
Looks like this sword
will only last one more swing.

22:00.570 --> 22:02.530
All right, why don't we try this...

22:05.240 --> 22:06.530
Limit off.

22:06.530 --> 22:09.660
♪Pierce through the world
That laugh at ideas♪

22:21.040 --> 22:26.050
♪We've arrived today carrying
Something that is unnamed♪

22:26.050 --> 22:31.050
♪All of it cannot be
Described by mere words♪

22:31.050 --> 22:33.730
♪We cannot accept that
Tomorrow is the future♪

22:33.730 --> 22:35.190
It sure went flying.

22:35.770 --> 22:38.730
Shame. I kinda want that greatsword.

22:39.690 --> 22:44.570
♪Gather the pieces of the broken heart♪

22:44.570 --> 22:47.160
♪And take back our voices♪

22:47.160 --> 22:49.260
It dropped a gem?

22:49.740 --> 22:51.200
I guess I'll hang onto it.

22:52.040 --> 22:55.200
I have a grasp of my strength
in this world now.

22:56.040 --> 22:58.570
A game that turned into reality, huh?

22:59.170 --> 23:00.980
That sounds pretty exciting.

23:02.330 --> 23:04.800
♪Even if your dream is disappearing♪

23:04.800 --> 23:08.260
♪Never give up the beat of your heart♪

23:08.260 --> 23:11.360
♪With the independence we've finally
Gained after falling many times♪

23:11.360 --> 23:12.640
Princess Rionne!

23:22.230 --> 23:25.150
W-what is the meaning of this...?

23:34.950 --> 23:39.920
(Next time, Episode 2: Tiny Partner)
